  {
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": "We'll take care of the amazing music.<br>All that's left for you is to:<br>celebrate, dance, and feel the excitement.",
   "headingAlign": "end",
   "columns": [
    "<p dir=\"ltr\">Celebrating a Bar/Bat Mitzvah?<br>Looking for unforgettable energy and experiences?<br>You deserve an event that will be remembered forever!<br>We’ll make sure to elevate the atmosphere and turn your Bar Mitzvah celebration into something truly special.<br>With a rich and diverse repertoire, infectious energy, and professional musicians, we’ll get <strong>all</strong> your guests dancing and celebrating – from the youngest to the oldest!</p><ul dir=\"ltr\"><li>Musical accompaniment for the ‘aliya latora’</li><li>Live music ensemble for the reception</li><li>Live band to raise the energy and get everyone dancing</li><li>After party with an incredible DJ</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\">We strive to create an unforgettable event for you. With nothing less than outstanding music, so you can simply – <strong>celebrate, dance, and feel the excitement</strong>.</p>"
